# CODEOWNERS — Partner Platform
#
# Defines code ownership for critical paths in the repository.
# GitHub automatically requests reviews from the listed owners
# when a pull request touches matching files.
#
# Syntax:  <pattern>  <@owner-or-team> [<@owner-or-team> ...]
#
# Reference:
#   GitHub  — https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners
#
# The maintainer team is shared with AtOM: the same people own both
# sides of the A2A wire, and a signing change has to land on both together.

